    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SQUADX proudly presents Arcadia: House of God, a Hack-and-Slash Team Showdown that blends high-speed action, strategic team play, and a futuristic sci-fi world. Enter the battlefield and compete for control over Anima, a powerful artifact that can reshape destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast-paced melee combat, customize your warrior with unique abilities, and challenge others in intense team-based battles. With deep character progression and diverse combat styles, every match is a test of skill and strategy. Do you have what it takes to claim victory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SQUADX proudly presents Arcadia: House of God, a Hack-and-Slash Team Showdown that blends high-speed action, strategic team play, and a futuristic sci-fi world. Enter the battlefield and compete for control over Anima, a powerful artifact that can reshape destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast-paced melee combat, customize your warrior with unique abilities, and challenge others in intense team-based battles. With deep character progression and diverse combat styles, every match is a test of skill and strategy. Do you have what it takes to claim victory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Arcadia: House of God is a high-speed Hack-and-Slash Team Showdown set in a futuristic sci-fi world. Customize your warrior, master dynamic combat mechanics, and compete in action-packed team battles. Dominate the arena, refine your strategy, and fight for supremacy!",
